</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Hypothesis 3 (Age vs marketing campaigns): </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'> Certain age groups are more likely to engage with our marketing campaigns and make more purchases than othersYounger customers ages 18-35 years old spend less on products compared to older age groups such as 46-55 years old.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Null hypothesis 3:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Age has no significant impact on campaign engagement </run>
