    <worksheet name='4. Avg total spend by household type'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Average Total Spend by Household type</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Created a calculated field called HOUSEHOLD TYPE to create an elseif statement to condition if a household has no dependants, or if they have any children only, or teenagers only, or both.

Using this newly created field, I want to see the average total spend by household type. 
We are able to see that No Dependants spend the most, next is Teenagers Only, then Both Children and Teenagers, and lastly Children Only

Formula:
If [Kidhome]= 0 and [Teenhome]= 0 then &apos;No Dependants&apos;
ElseIf [Kidhome] &gt; 0 and [Teenhome]= 0 then &apos;Children Only&apos;
ElseIF [Kidhome]= 0 and [Teenhome] &gt; 0 then &apos;Teenagers Only&apos;
ELSE &apos;Both Children &amp; Teenagers&apos;
END</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='Capstone-Retail Analytics by Inigo Arboleda' name='federated.1axk95m0px4xhh19h5lsh0q82ydb' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.1axk95m0px4xhh19h5lsh0q82ydb'>
            <column caption='Total Spend' datatype='integer' name='[Calculation_3669418703953922]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='[MntWines]+&#10;[MntFruits]+&#10;[MntMeatProducts]+&#10;[MntFishProducts]+&#10;[MntSweetProducts]+&#10;[MntGoldProds]' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Household Type' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_3669419738980367]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='If [Kidhome]= 0 and [Teenhome]= 0 then &apos;No Dependants&apos;&#10;ElseIf [Kidhome] &gt; 0 and [Teenhome]= 0 then &apos;Children Only&apos;&#10;ElseIF [Kidhome]= 0 and [Teenhome] &gt; 0 then &apos;Teenagers Only&apos;&#10;ELSE &apos;Both Children &amp; Teenagers&apos;&#10;END' />
            </column>
            <column datatype='integer' name='[Kidhome]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Mnt Fish Products' datatype='integer' name='[MntFishProducts]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Mnt Fruits' datatype='integer' name='[MntFruits]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Mnt Gold Prods' datatype='integer' name='[MntGoldProds]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
