        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif'>Hypothesis 4 (Household vs marketing campaigns):</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif'>Customers with children and/or teenagers at home are less likely to engage with marketing campaigns compared to customers without dependants.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif'>Null hypothesis 4:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif'>There is no significant effect on customer campaign engagement based on whether they have children or teenagers at home. </run>
