                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> - 0 dependents: 59.3%</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Avg. Total Spend Chart:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> - Elseif: </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> - No dependents, Teenagers only, </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>children only, and both</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- No dep. most avg. spend</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Total Spend Box Plot:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> - No dependants $703,262 TOTAL</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> - Teenagers Only $458,835 TOTAL</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> - Children Only $96,614 TOTAL</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> - Both children and teenagers $95,044 TOTAL</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> - Customers with No dependants have the highest median spend. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> - Customers with both children and teenagers show the lowest overall spending</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
