            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - 1629 about 72.8% of our customers did not engage with campaigns</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Number of enrollment per year:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - 2012-2014</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - 2012: 491</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - 2013: 1189</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - 2014: 556</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Which product most revenue:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - Wine: Highest revenue</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'> - Meats: Second Highest revenue</run>
